      "t": "When Nagiyev learns that Senya ate the pastry containing the diamond ring, he nearly strangles the terrified cook on the spot. Desperate to retrieve the ring before Kristina grows suspicious in the dining room, Barinov mixes an awful kitchen laxative and forces Senya to drink it.",
